	(text "FPGA + CAPTURE MEMORY\nU601 iCE40HX4K-TQ144: bank 3 = ADC (24 data + 2 overflow, CLK_10M on GBIN6),\n  bank 0 = FT2232H sync FIFO (FT_CLK 60 MHz on GBIN0) + SDRAM control,\n  bank 1 = SDRAM DQ/address, bank 2 = LEDs, expansion header J601 (TRIG_IN on GBIN5).\nU602 W9812G6KH-6 SDR SDRAM, 16 MB (8M x 16). Two 12-bit channels packed in 32 bits/sample-pair:\n  0.1 s @ 10 MSPS = 1 M pairs = 4 MB -> 4x margin (~0.4 s max record).\n  Write bandwidth needed 40 MB/s; SDRAM at 100 MHz x 16 bit = 200 MB/s peak.\nU603 W25Q32JV config flash (iCE40 SPI master boot). Programmed through FT2232H ch B (iceprog -I B)\n  while FPGA is held in reset (FPGA_CRESET_N low). R602-R604: pull-ups on SS/CRESET/CDONE.\nPLL supplies filtered 100 ohm + 10 uF + 100 nF per Lattice iCE40 hardware checklist."
		(at 381 259.08 0)
